# A root that ends on a bundle (Type System ch. 2, "Bundles and sparse tuples": a plain
# aggregate with functor values inside): the World hears the root's result (Semantics
# ch. 7, "The outputs"), the bundle's plain part at the build and each firing of its event
# in the tick it fires. Written by Claude on the claude-lowering branch; subject to change.
emit Ui.*
test mod Tests

@main: @((!Nat, Text))
@main:
    !go <- Ui.Button($label=$"go")                                # 0
    $n <- 0 then $n + 1 on !go
    Ui.Label($text=$"{$n}")                                       # 1
    @ ((($n + 1) on !go, "ready"))
